<title>USA: Barry's delays earnings report.</title>
<headline>Barry's delays earnings report.</headline>
<dateline>MONROVIA, Calif. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barry's Jewelers Inc said Tuesday that it has delayed filing its quarterly earnings report for its third fiscal quarter, ended February 28.</p>
<p>The company said its management team has been recently replaced by a new management group that has been required to devote substantially all its attention to evaluating restructuring initiatives.</p>
<p>The company said it is negotiating with its banks to obtain a waiver of certain covenants to avert a non-monetary default of its revolving credit agreement.</p>
